## Scenario 2: Immediate Uplink — No Delay
##
## TCP terrestrial peer delivers bundles.
## LTP contact to satellite (node 20) is available from the start.
## Bundles flow through immediately without queuing.
##
## This demonstrates real-time forwarding when contact is available.

1 10 ''
s

# Self-contact
a contact +0 +86400 10 10 100000000

# Terrestrial link (node 30) — available immediately
a contact +0 +86400 10 30 100000000
a contact +0 +86400 30 10 100000000

# Satellite link (node 20) — available immediately
a contact +0 +86400 10 20 9600
a contact +0 +86400 20 10 9600

# Ranges
a range +0 +86400 10 10 0
a range +0 +86400 10 20 1
a range +0 +86400 20 10 1
a range +0 +86400 10 30 0
a range +0 +86400 30 10 0
